<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on DTB-Bund and DTB-Bolb futures.</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on DTB-Bund and DTB-Bolb futures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schweizerischer Bankverein (Deutschland) AG has issued 170 million American-style call and put warrants, in 17 equal tranches, on DTB-Bobl-futures and DTB-Bund-futures, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>There are four tranches on the March 1997 DTB-Bobl-future, five tranches on the March 1997 DTB-Bund future and eight tranches on the June 1997 DTB-Bund futures.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> PAYDATE	   06.JAN.97		 MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> LISTING	   FRANKFURT, DUSSELDORF</p>
<p> NOTES	     ONE WARRANT CONTROLS 100 DEM NOMINAL.</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
